# Trellis: retain appended text when journals meet across worktrees.
# Union is not record-aware: concurrent uncommitted writers can reuse a
# session number or interleave blocks. Review both records after merging.
#
# Do NOT add a rule for workspace/*/index.md here — it is fully regenerated
# every session. Resolve conflicts using both journals; picking either side
# can omit a history row. Preserve user-maintained index content.
.trellis/workspace/*/journal-*.md merge=union

# Normalize line endings on checkin. Windows contributors save with CRLF by
# default, and without this git records the whole file as rewritten: #555
# arrived as a 2159-line diff for ~75 lines of real work, and would have
# landed three files with line endings unlike the rest of the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zstd binary
